ed by the Ryujoji, Shiro challenges her to a duel. Later, Jiyu meets a Ryujoji assassin, he explains their 300-year old grudge and goal to her.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dszYBTlGSpQj1Vt2bUHCO0eougw.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"76","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"635","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"635","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"34723","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"73703","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"47965","synopsis":"Jubei II defeats the assassins. Afterward, Shiro and Jubei II engage in a duel, he cuts off the Eyepatch, but as soon as Jiyu returns to her normal self, she collapses. Bantaro takes her to a doctor while Hajime attacks Shiro, and takes the Eyepatch.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/e1Sx6sRyN2A7qBojOCYZKzvGp9p.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"Jubei II defeats the assassins. Afterward, Shiro and Jubei II engage in a duel, he cuts off the Eyepatch, but as soon as Jiyu returns to her normal self, she collapses. Bantaro takes her to a doctor while Hajime attacks Shiro, and takes the Eyepatch.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/e1Sx6sRyN2A7qBojOCYZKzvGp9p.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"76","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"635","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"635","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"34723","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"73703","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"47966","synops