r.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fKNOTYepdtmmi3RghUKX3I0bNiW.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 11","synopsis":"Mikage while exploring the Ryujoji's hideout, she was attacked by Shiro/Taiko Daiyu and was heavily injured. Sai finds her Mikage stumbles out and collapses in front of him. He brings her home, treats her and then hugs her, but Jiyu sees everything and runs off. Mikage tells him to protect Jiyu and that the Ryujoji grudge lives on. As soon as she runs outside, a possessed Shiro appears and attacks her.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fKNOTYepdtmmi3RghUKX3I0bNiW.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 12","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"76","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"635","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"635","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"34723","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"73703","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]}],"link":"47970","synopsis":"The fight between the possessed Shiro and Jubei II continues as Sai tries to stop them. Jubei II however, says that she has to end this grudge and Jiyu's soul will rest in her eternally.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aUMtMcwQKYUKJF02iywHBq51oED.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 12","synopsis":"The fight between the possessed Shiro and Jubei II continues as Sai tries to stop them. Jubei II however, says that she has to end this grudge and Jiyu's soul will rest in her eternally.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aUMtMcwQKYUKJF02iywHBq51oED.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 13","episodeNumber":13,"sourceEpisodeNumber":13,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"76","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"anil